<title>INDIA: Yield at Indian 91-day t-bill steady at 7.98 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield at Indian 91-day t-bill steady at 7.98 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it maintained a cut-off price of 98.05 rupees at its weekly auction of 91-day treasury bills on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was unchanged at 7.98 percent.</p>
<p>--</p>
